395	const ELI5_RULES = `Audience: Korean players aged 15-20 (ELI5 "Age 15" + "Senior High/College" styles).
396	- Casual but not cringey, no "fellow kids" energy. Use "-요" polite casual Korean.
397	- Analogies from games, phones, social media, school life.
398	- One idea per sentence. Concrete over abstract.
399	- Any jargon gets a definition inline, e.g. "코어 루프(게임에서 계속 반복하는 행동)".
400	- No emoji, no marketing voice, no invented numbers or facts.`;
